{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"晨早新聞重點｜內地推出三項穩定資本市場措施／選委結果出爐　多界別「爆冷」\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/H-CNSTK-EFFORT-261123A.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】11月23日now早晨新聞重點</p><p>【穩定措施】內地推出三項穩定資本市場措施，包括下調融資保證金比例及推出新一批降費措施。</p><p>【選委結果出爐】選委會選舉結果出爐，多個界別「爆冷」，湯文龍、陳家強雙雙落敗。</p><p>【疑烏方攻擊】有俄羅斯船隻停泊在北非利比亞海軍基地期間，懷疑遭到烏軍攻擊起火。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:44:11.514041+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:19:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T18:32:28.652362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T23:37:43.275476+00:00","content_hash":"917c3d55638d0ea583ea6e6d3417a26d3aa963fbeec5e7762d90f1a15f7a3852","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T23:44:11.514041+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}